title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: linke_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "LINKE" and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/SeveringCarl.jpg

= Internal Security

The Interior Ministry controls internal security throughout the German Republic. While most police work is delegated to the states, the national security agency can perform special investigations.

As with the state police units and the Reichswehr, the internal police tends to be <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span>, and has serious issues with loyalty to the elected government of the Republic.

- @loyalty: Improve the loyalty of the Interior Ministry forces.
- @investigate_corruption: Investigate corruption by big businesses.
- @investigate_far_right: persecute far right
- @verfassung_influence: influence verfassungschutz
- @certified_extremists: brand afd extremist
- @request_afd_ban: request afd ban
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loyalty
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; beweli_dissent += 1; cdu_relation -= 1;

Current interior police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]

@investigate_corruption
choose-if: econ_moderation < 9
unavailable-subtitle: econ moderation
go-to: investigate_corruption_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.5; investigate_corruption_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5

@investigate_corruption_success
on-arrival: investigate_corruption += 1; urban_linke += 3*(1-dissent); inflation -= 0.1 if inflation > 3; inflation -= 0.2 if inflation >= 8; fdp_relation -= 3; spd_relation -= 1; spd_coalition_dissent += 0.3;

Corruption in big business is rampant, of course. We have uncovered a number of scandals, and publicizing them brings new attention to the work of Interior Minister [+ interior_minister +], building up his popular appeal and that of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>.


@investigate_corruption_failure
on-arrival: urban_linke -= 0.5;

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.

@investigate_far_right
go-to: investigate_far_right_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.55; investigate_far_right_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55

@investigate_far_right_success
on-arrival: persecuted_afd += 1; urban_afd -= 1; east_afd -= 1; youth_afd -= 1; urban_afd -= 2 if persecuted_afd >= 3; youth_afd -= 2 if persecuted_afd >= 3; east_afd -= 2 if persecuted_afd >= 3; cdu_relation -= 2; verfassungsschutz_progress += (persecuted_afd)/4;

@investigate_far_right_failure
on-arrival: youth_afd += 0.5; issue_antifascism -= 0.5;

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.

@verfassung_influence
view-if: afd_certified_extremist == 0
on-arrival: verfassungsschutz_progress += 1; cdu_relation -= 1; issue_antifascism += 0.2;

@certified_extremists
view-if: afd_certified_extremist == 0 and verfassungsschutz_progress >= 3
choose-if: issue_antifascism >= 2
on-arrival: pro_status_quo -= 5; issue_antifascism += 0.2; cdu_relation -= 2; fdp_relation -= 1; afd_certified_extremist += 1; youth_linke += ((issue_antifascism)/3); east_afd += (7-(newspapers+social_media)); youth_afd += (7-(newspapers+social_media)); urban_afd += (6-(newspapers+social_media)); rural_afd += (6-(newspapers+social_media)); verfassungsschutz_progress += 1;

@request_afd_ban
view-if: afd_certified_extremist == 1 and afd_ban_requested == 0
choose-if: verfassungsschutz_progress >= 6 and issue_antifascism >= 4 and justice_minister_party = "LINKE" and judicial_reform >= 2 and spd_coalition_dissent < 1 and greens_coalition_dissent < 1
on-arrival: afd_ban_requested += 1; pro_status_quo -= 5; issue_antifascism -= 1.5;
